---
import NavHeader from '../components/NavHeader.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import '../styles/base.css';

// Page metadata
const title = 'Our Mission | Stories From The Web';
const description = 'Discover our mission to empower young writers, promote literacy, and create a safe space for children to share and discover stories.';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-neutral-50 text-text-primary font-sans">
    <NavHeader />
    
    <main class="flex-grow w-full">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-8 max-w-4xl">
        <header class="mb-12 text-center">
          <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">
            Our Mission
          </h1>
          <p class="text-xl text-text-secondary max-w-3xl mx-auto">
            Empowering young voices, fostering creativity, and building a community 
            where every child's story matters
          </p>
        </header>

        <!-- Mission Statement Banner -->
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-primary/20 to-secondary/20 rounded-xl p-8 mb-12 text-center shadow-md">
          <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Our Mission Statement</h2>
          <p class="text-lg md:text-xl italic">
            "To create a safe, inclusive platform where children can share their stories, 
            develop their writing skills, and discover diverse voices that inspire a lifelong 
            love of reading and storytelling."
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md p-8 mb-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">Core Mission Pillars</h2>
          
          <div class="space-y-8">
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6">
              <div class="md:w-1/3 flex justify-center">
                <div class="bg-primary/10 rounded-full p-6 h-32 w-32 flex items-center justify-center">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-16 w-16 text-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M11 5.882V19.24a1.76 1.76 0 01-3.417.592l-2.147-6.15M18 13a3 3 0 100-6M5.436 13.683A4.001 4.001 0 017 6h1.832c4.1 0 7.625-1.234 9.168-3v14c-1.543-1.766-5.067-3-9.168-3H7a3.988 3.988 0 01-1.564-.317z" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="md:w-2/3">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Amplifying Children's Voices</h3>
                <p class="mb-3">
                  We believe that children have important stories to tell. Our platform provides a space 
                  where young authors aged 5-13 can publish their work and have their voices heard by a 
                  wider audience.
                </p>
                <p>
                  By giving children a platform to share their stories, we validate their experiences, 
                  perspectives, and creativity, helping them build confidence in their writing and in themselves.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6">
              <div class="md:w-1/3 flex justify-center">
                <div class="bg-secondary/10 rounded-full p-6 h-32 w-32 flex items-center justify-center">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-16 w-16 text-secondary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="md:w-2/3">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Promoting Literacy and Education</h3>
                <p class="mb-3">
                  Reading and writing are fundamental skills that open doors to opportunity. We're committed 
                  to supporting literacy development by providing engaging content that makes reading fun 
                  and by encouraging children to express themselves through writing.
                </p>
                <p>
                  We work with educators to develop resources that can be used in classrooms and libraries, 
                  making our platform a valuable educational tool that complements formal learning.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6">
              <div class="md:w-1/3 flex justify-center">
                <div class="bg-tertiary/10 rounded-full p-6 h-32 w-32 flex items-center justify-center">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-16 w-16 text-tertiary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="md:w-2/3">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Building an Inclusive Community</h3>
                <p class="mb-3">
                  We're creating a community where children from all backgrounds feel welcome and represented. 
                  We actively seek out diverse voices and stories that reflect a wide range of experiences, 
                  cultures, and perspectives.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Through our platform, children can connect with peers who share their interests, learn about 
                  different cultures and experiences, and develop empathy and understanding through storytelling.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6">
              <div class="md:w-1/3 flex justify-center">
                <div class="bg-accent/10 rounded-full p-6 h-32 w-32 flex items-center justify-center">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-16 w-16 text-accent" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="md:w-2/3">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Ensuring a Safe Digital Environment</h3>
                <p class="mb-3">
                  Children deserve a safe space to explore, create, and connect online. We maintain strict 
                  content moderation policies, age-appropriate design, and robust privacy protections to 
                  ensure our platform is a secure environment for young users.
                </p>
                <p>
                  We're committed to digital citizenship education, helping children learn how to navigate 
                  online spaces responsibly and respectfully while protecting their privacy and wellbeing.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md p-8 mb-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">Our Impact Goals</h2>
          
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
              <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
                <div class="bg-primary/20 p-2 rounded-full mr-3">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Inspire Young Writers</h3>
              </div>
              <p>
                Encourage 100,000 children to write and share their stories by 2025, 
                helping them develop confidence in their creative abilities.
              </p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
              <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
                <div class="bg-primary/20 p-2 rounded-full mr-3">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Support Literacy Development</h3>
              </div>
              <p>
                Partner with 500 schools and libraries to integrate our platform into 
                their literacy programs, reaching children across the UK.
              </p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
              <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
                <div class="bg-primary/20 p-2 rounded-full mr-3">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Promote Diverse Voices</h3>
              </div>
              <p>
                Ensure our platform represents the full diversity of children's experiences, 
                with stories from authors of all backgrounds and abilities.
              </p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
              <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
                <div class="bg-primary/20 p-2 rounded-full mr-3">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Foster Digital Literacy</h3>
              </div>
              <p>
                Develop resources that help children navigate digital spaces safely and 
                responsibly, building skills for the digital age.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md p-8 mb-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">How We're Achieving Our Mission</h2>
          
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Platform Development</h3>
              <p>
                We're continuously improving our platform to make it more accessible, engaging, and 
                user-friendly for children of all ages and abilities. This includes age-appropriate 
                design, accessibility features, and intuitive interfaces.
              </p>
            </div>
            
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Educational Partnerships</h3>
              <p>
                We work with schools, libraries, and educational organizations to integrate our platform 
                into literacy programs and provide resources for educators to use in their classrooms.
              </p>
            </div>
            
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Community Engagement</h3>
              <p>
                We organize writing contests, virtual author visits, and other events that engage our 
                community and provide opportunities for young writers to develop their skills and connect 
                with peers and mentors.
              </p>
            </div>
            
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Content Curation</h3>
              <p>
                Our team carefully curates content to ensure it meets our quality standards, represents 
                diverse perspectives, and provides value to our young readers and writers.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center mt-10">
          <p class="text-lg mb-6">
            Join us in our mission to empower young voices and foster a love of storytelling.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
            <a href="/publish" class="inline-block bg-primary text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-primary-dark transition-colors">
              Share Your Story
            </a>
            <a href="/partners" class="inline-block bg-secondary text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-secondary-dark transition-colors">
              Partner With Us
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
    
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
